{"channelId":"UCGb_c0j3vHX1cJNYhhiAKYA","row":["Goldy's Farm Live (www.GoldysFarm.com)",2670,"OUR MISSION is to improve the welfare of community seniors and veterans by interacting with our rescued and rehabilitated sanctuary animals.  \n\nwww.GoldysFarm.com\n\nGoldy's Farm offers free visits to senior centers and veterans centers on the North Shore of Boston, Massachusetts.  Our farm in Ipswich, Massachusetts is also open for schedule visits from seniors and veterans.  \nGoldy's Farm is a positively fun and adventurous atmosphere.  We excel at the joy and humor of animals.  Follow us on Facebook, enjoy the Livestream cameras, or meet others online who enjoy our animals virtually.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGb_c0j3vHX1cJNYhhiAKYA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGb_c0j3vHX1cJNYhhiAKYA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:58.159Z","channelId":"UCGb_c0j3vHX1cJNYhhiAKYA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"19c232e1141042b5340da1dd343c5b4c8940e551c17d055b438c1a036d2140e1","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"bb2c22368f0b5045339ff1a30fdb4199d166c1dc25acd125c9e34aca3cc38844"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGb_c0j3vHX1cJNYhhiAKYA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:58.159Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGb_c0j3vHX1cJNYhhiAKYA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2670,"raw":"2.67K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGb_c0j3vHX1cJNYhhiAKYA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:58.159Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"organization_self_r